[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) merged every report about wrong dates into one ticket, because their
subject lines matched ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)). Read by what each
report says, and placed by its tenant and form instead of by subject, the ticket holds three
problems. Each has its own ticket now, and each needs its own fix.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. #4471 closed on 5 October with the parser fixed and booking-v3 retired. That
covers the first two rows below. The one-day move is still open: nothing that closed #4471 touches it.
</Callout>

## What #4471 holds

<SplitTable
  ticket={4471}
  issues={{
    parser: 'https://github.com/kNowakowska/support-kb-4471/issues/1',
    hint: 'https://github.com/kNowakowska/support-kb-4471/issues/2',
    move: 'https://github.com/kNowakowska/support-kb-4471/issues/3',
